    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Natalia ***",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115936091480439028610/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIkri9LhXUEsIzQfCqwEfMiyZvSMJEVJ-9ZJbpHW5ILcihtQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I was really surprised since it was a fantastic service. I went to may different walk in clinic but this one left behind all of them, starting with girl receptionist and finishing with the doctor itself. They understood that it was emergency and book us between patience so at least to see us and help us. visit itself left us with a deeply happiness that we saw a specialist indeed and helped us in all the ways we need. if you need experienced doctor and fast response without hidden fees or no open file charge - that’s were suppose to call and go. Not to mention easy access from main roads and place for parking. another important moment - tourist or visitors are welcomed as well.",
        "time": 1757855448,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aziza Ait El Fquih",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107104919197967282951/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJSiUuIg6holCOJ427uB_ClIrhkaUIX_bCJXdFuHpTmsrR8u8jZA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I'm very satisfied after treatment of varicose, it's a big difference I feel my feet are lighter and also prettier 😍 I recommend Dr Vitalie he is very professional he did good job 👏",
        "time": 1765324553,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniil Sirbu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109145400602203064955/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL8EfL8t2yA1IneAvPu1Di6uKpgP_wFLevU7AJiMn7ox5XTlQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Had sclerotherapy at Clinique Idyllium in May for my varicose veins. Finally bit the bullet after years of them bugging me at work. Waited maybe 10 mins, doc was friendly and explained it all quick. Procedure took 45 mins, stung a bit but no big deal. Legs feel lighter now, veins are fading great after a couple months, even survived a long road trip with no issues. Price was fair, no hidden fees. Would go back 5/5!",
        "time": 1759266549,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daria Krutauz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118159555344407123792/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX2RB82vBSlVU-lns-gW4FnraLpBTTb4ciVgoRloIpnlmlMb6irPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Great service. The staff is attentive to details. The professional consultation is provided before each treatment.",
        "time": 1760203892,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Micheline Allan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108046919728211501946/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbtsPtoKpgtYIYejID0CO00g8KRaPss93Dm4Gd7d3v8Pnq3Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I am being treated for varicose veins by Dr. Vitalie and am pleased with results I am seeing.  I decided to attend the clinic to take advantage of promotions available today in support of the Breast Cancer Foundation and to make a donation as well.  Speaking to others who were in attendance served to confirm for me that I have made the right choices.  I feel confident that I am in competent hands with both Dr. Vitalie and Dr. Tatiana.",
